<title>JAPAN: Japan March domestic WPI unchanged yr/yr - BOJ. [CORRECTED 01:10 GMT]</title>
<headline>Japan March domestic WPI unchanged yr/yr - BOJ. [CORRECTED 01:10 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's domestic wholesale price index, a key component of the overall WPI, was unchanged in March from a year earlier, but down (corrects from up) 0.1 percent from the previous month, the Bank of Japan (BOJ) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The following is a breakdown of the March WPI:</p>
<p>Year-on-year change (percent)</p>
<p>	    March	 February</p>
<p> Overall   +1.6	  +1.6</p>
<p> Domestic   0.0	  -0.2</p>
<p> Exports   +5.1	  +5.5</p>
<p> Imports  +15.8	 +16.5</p>
<p>Month-on-month change (percent, index base year 1990):</p>
<p>	    March	 February   March Index</p>
<p> Overall   -0.1	  +0.6	 94.2</p>
<p>(Corrects figure for March column to -0.1 from +0.1.)</p>
<p> Domestic  +0.1	  +0.1	 95.4</p>
<p> Exports   -0.4	  +2.5	 89.3</p>
<p> Imports   -1.0	  +3.4	 90.0</p>
</text>
